{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle for patient lives in this hospital-themed card battler! Roll dice to heal or harm as medical staff clash in chaotic wards. Rogue-like progression meets deck-building strategy in this darkly humorous take on healthcare chaos</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice driven combat: roll dice to gain resources, heal patients, or to go on the attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual objectives: combat\u00a0ill-intentioned staff, while also trying to protect patients caught in the crossfire</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rouge-like progression: when your cards fall, the run ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck evolution: tweak and upgrade your deck between rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random upgrades: at the end of each round there is a chance for an upgrade which can help progression in the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save lives or succumb to the chaos of understaffed wards and administrative nightmares? Every dice roll matters when patients' lives are on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for fans of:</strong> Card battlers, medical dramas, dark humor, and strategic gameplay with meaningful choices.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750580?t=1761786900","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750580?t=1761786900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750580/febb38c8fac4fbca2c35a616ceb11368f971ab26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761786900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750580/febb38c8fac4fbca2c35a616ceb11368f971ab26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761786900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descri